 "text": "-->\nRegister of Deeds | Allen County KS\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nAllen County\nKansas\nAllen County\nKansas\nAllen County\nKansas\nHome\nDepartments\n911 Services\nAppraiser\nAttorney\nCommissioners\nCounty Clerk\nEMS\nJudicial\nLEPC\nPublic Works\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\n911 Services\nAppraiser\nAttorney\nCommissioners\nCounty Clerk\nEMS\nJudicial\nLEPC\nPublic Works\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nTourism\nLocal Restaurants & Motels\nBowlus Fine Arts Center\nAllen County Historical Society\nLocal History\nEvents\nChurches\nLocal Restaurants & Motels\nBowlus Fine Arts Center\nAllen County Historical Society\nLocal History\nEvents\nChurches\nInformation\nAllen County GROW\nBusiness Links\nCommunity\nEconomic Development\nEducation\nEmployment Information\nHolidays\nOpen Records Request Form\nPlanning and Zoning\nPrescription Discount Card\nPublications\nServices to the Elderly\nTownships\nAllen County GROW\nBusiness Links\nCommunity\nEconomic Development\nEducation\nEmployment Information\nHolidays\nOpen Records Request Form\nPlanning and Zoning\nPrescription Discount Card\nPublications\nServices to the Elderly\nTownships\nMenu\nNOTICE: REGISTERS OF DEEDS ARE RECORDERS OF DOCUMENTS, NOT RESEARCHERS. WE CANNOT BE RESPONSIBLE FOR ANY MISSED DOCUMENTS. PLEASE CONTACT A TITLE COMPANY OR ABSTRACT OFFICE FOR A COMPLETE RECORD SEARCH.\nRegister of Deeds\nSearch Options\nFee Schedule\neRecording\nRecording Requirements\nForms\nOpen Records\nGenealogy\nRegister of Deeds Association\nView More Pages\nRegister Of Deeds\nThe Allen County Register of Deeds, in partnership with Fidlar Software, is offering a FREE service to the property owners of Allen County to help combat property and mortgage fraud. PROPERTY FRAUD ALERT (PFA) is a notification service that alerts subscribers (via email or phone) if the name entered by the subscriber occurs in any future recording activity. To learn more about PFA or to sign up for this FREE service, go to Property Fraud Alert or phone 1-800-728-3858 for assistance.\nMisty Rice\nContact Us!\nEmail: regofdeeds@allencounty.org\nPhone: 620-365-1412\nMailing & Street Address\n1 N. Washington, Iola, KS 66749\nHours Of Operation\nOffice Hours:\nMonday-Friday 8:00-5:00\nRecording Hours:\nMonday-Friday; 8:00-4:30\nE-Recording Hours:\nMonday-Friday; 8:00-4:15\nContact Us At Allen County!\nPhone Number: 620-365-1407 | Email: coclerk@allencounty.org |\nAcceptable Use Policy\nWebsite by Jayhawk Software\nHome\nDepartments\n911 Services\nAppraiser\nAttorney\nCommissioners\nCounty Clerk\nEMS\nJudicial\nLEPC\nPublic Works\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nTourism\nLocal Restaurants & Motels\nBowlus Fine Arts Center\nAllen County Historical Society\nLocal History\nEvents\nChurches\nInformation\nAllen County GROW\nBusiness Links\nCommunity\nEconomic Development\nEducation\nEmployment Information\nHolidays\nOpen Records Request Form\nPlanning and Zoning\nPrescription Discount Card\nPublications\nServices to the Elderly\nTownships\nClose\nClose\nbottom of page",
